# EmailJS (https://www.emailjs.com) - powers the contact form.
# 1. Create a free account, add an Email Service (connect luka.bakula1@gmail.com via Gmail).
# 2. Create an Email Template with variables: from_name, from_email, phone, subject, message,
#    and set its "To Email" to luka.bakula1@gmail.com so submissions land in that inbox.
# 3. Copy the IDs below into a local .env file (never commit .env - it's gitignored).
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
